1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,805
Hold the door!
快帮我扶住门！

2
00:00:01,905 --> 00:00:04,643
I've got it! Keep running!
我扶住了！快跑！

3
00:00:04,743 --> 00:00:06,902
Three... two...
三……二……

4
00:00:07,002 --> 00:00:10,062
My sister's night-light went out.
我妹妹的小夜灯灭了。

5
00:00:10,162 --> 00:00:12,496
Is that a moon?
那是一颗月亮吗？

6
00:00:12,596 --> 00:00:16,172
A little one. She's scared of the dark.
一颗小月亮。她怕黑。

7
00:00:16,272 --> 00:00:18,925
Next stop: her island!
下一站：她住的小岛！

8
00:00:19,025 --> 00:00:21,108
Tick, hold the door!
蒂克，帮我扶住门！

9
00:00:21,208 --> 00:00:23,408
You brought the moon!
你把月亮带来了！

10
00:00:23,508 --> 00:00:25,589
Just for you.
专门给你的。

11
00:00:26,139 --> 00:00:29,189
Hold the door!
请帮我扶住门！

12
00:00:29,489 --> 00:00:33,189
Hold the elevator, please!
请帮我等一下电梯！
